{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "c980d36c70188ad1be4f00a729ef4a2d86a48786f85fc5dd74722e4ac2652109", "ja": "カンペキなチーム、結成や☆", "zh": "完美团队，结成啦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b78f04155fd7b89d307d752546ae81aea4208d122e509e0edee7f17b0b32c2f9", "ja": "紬＆風花に続き、オープニング撮影を終えた\n茜と響。突然話しかけてきた同世代の女の子\nが、自分達がアンバサダーを務める弁当屋の\n社長と知って驚く。打ち合わせをしながら、\nすぐに打ち解けた3人は、勝利を誓い合う。", "zh": "继紬和风花之后，茜与响也结束了开场拍摄。没想到突然前来搭话的同龄女孩，竟是她们担任大使的便当店老板，两人对此十分惊讶。一边商量着相关事宜，3人很快便熟络起来，并相互约定要赢得胜利。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1000_null", "source_sha256": "d42e005fd5add679d4e7123b59fdf5bab16c97fb35064aadd5b20fb01bd0044e", "ja": "響＆茜チーム", "zh": "响＆茜队", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "78d8a913b4d9eb1aade78edd7c13dc2edf82f048b243fcf3b90fe95e8aec82d3", "ja": "……むむむ！　紬と風花、もうブースに\n向かったみたいだね。気合い十分って感じだぞ！", "zh": "……唔唔唔！紬和风花好像已经\n往展位那边去了呢。感觉干劲十足啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "cca8f14504df638ea90da5d967c3d38cd155715e46b66319c86fda4aa2ec2551", "ja": "大変！　茜ちゃん達も早く行かなきゃ。\nブースでの売り上げで、負けちゃうかも……！", "zh": "糟糕！　小茜她们也得快点过去才行。\n展位的销量说不定会输掉的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "2170faf0e2b2666ad7be28f8e2b8f3deae1bb031414e1b1e79a3d8fb87ea3d47", "ja": "茜、慌てちゃダメだぞ！　もちろん売り上げは\n大事だけど、それだけじゃないからね。", "zh": "茜，不能慌！销售额当然很重要，\n但不只是这一项哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "c2fd479dbab58e5e6ad1dfc898f07725dbe16e38b1f28a7de9d6c96ee03db123", "ja": "スタジオでの実食と、WEB投票。それと、一日の\n売り上げ。この3つのポイントの合計を競うんだ！", "zh": "要比拼的是在摄影棚进行试吃、WEB投票，以及一天的营业额——这3个要点的总分！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "e5a84058eebbd20db34483e41963d864193c4611369903722f5f1c54446b6cf5", "ja": "ふむふむ、つまり……落ち着いて戦略を立てて挑むのも\nアリ、ってコトだね☆　そういうの茜ちゃん大得意！", "zh": "嗯嗯，也就是说……冷静地制定战略再去挑战，也是一种选择，对吧☆这种事小茜最擅长了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "0dfd1eda596b8ce945a423862c0b9fbdcef878ed8b3ca64b2405fa84b2cc14c3", "ja": "そうそう。それじゃ、ブースに向かいながら\n作戦会議さー！　自分達は頭脳戦もカンペキだからね♪", "zh": "对对。那我们一边往展位走，一边开作战会议啦——！我们的头脑战也完美无缺哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1007_p", "source_sha256": "0e21671bd3531d0544eeba1f40a566eefba8167ae6f4f2153c398511dd2c54ac", "ja": "響、茜、お疲れさま！\n撮影、カンペキだったな！", "zh": "响、茜，辛苦了！\n刚才的拍摄很完美啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "fe77532c627c4581423d4173d8babbf96bfa4be7c26bc42b1beb8820690ef5b5", "ja": "うぎゃー！　自分「カンペキだったでしょ！」って\n言おうとしたのに……先に言わないでよね！", "zh": "呜呀——！人家本来想说“我表现得很完美吧！”的……别抢先说嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "1e7786ea925f50987c41270f03ae78a13ec1e11ea91d9fcb5c6c842523c08f12", "ja": "茜ちゃんとひびきんなら、これくらい当然だよ♪\n本番もバッチリ盛り上げちゃうから、乞うご期待！", "zh": "有小茜和响的话，这点当然啦♪正式演出时也会让现场热闹起来的，敬请期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1010_onnanoko", "source_sha256": "e5c8b79a48e0a3cf379758f5ddad035389f61f05254aac7a41ac56a569aec635", "ja": "おーっ、頼もしいなぁ♪\nメッチャ期待してるから、よろしくでーす！", "zh": "哦——真让人放心呀♪\n我可是非常期待的，就拜托你啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "7d7e6b951fd716d2c5878c2f159b5b5192f0b7f8a4375419db2815b5de105010", "ja": "え……あ、ファンの子？　ゴメンね、まだ撮影中で……\nもう少しだけ、外で待っててくれるかニャ？", "zh": "诶……啊，是粉丝吗？抱歉，还在拍摄中……\n能不能再在外面稍微等一会儿喵？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1012_onnanoko", "source_sha256": "43e710a19a78a842d8034fcaffec8062d177f2f427bccd0365bce5137ff94a26", "ja": "あははっ！　心配いらんで、うちも関係者やから♪", "zh": "啊哈哈！不用担心啦，我也算相关人员嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1013_p", "source_sha256": "74b2682aaaa8391a421024130e83e0f53f270387af45b960444ee98ada6bccbb", "ja": "あ……ああ、どうも！　響、茜。\nこの人が、ふたりが応援する弁当屋の社長さんだよ。", "zh": "啊……啊，你好！响、茜。\n这位就是你们俩支持的便当店老板。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1014_013hib", "source_sha256": "5bd5a201917387ae59c9481811638cd860e533467f50aaf14a5d802ad3385a4a", "ja": "ええっ！？　この子が……？\n自分達と同い年くらいなのに、すごいぞ～！", "zh": "诶！？这孩子……？\n明明和我们差不多大，真厉害啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1015_shachochan", "source_sha256": "9c90203fea35961c2eb4a31725e15d6340054fd25f1f10a43a95e04a2fd10855", "ja": "えー、アイドルのが凄いと思うけどなぁ。\n撮影してる言うから、ダッシュで見に来たんよ！", "zh": "诶——我觉得偶像的才更厉害吧。\n听说在拍摄，我就一路冲过来看啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1016_p", "source_sha256": "952118b9b07d49042e8bdb5b309705264192df4aa92275c59ad15d2d36190706", "ja": "すみません、この後お伺いする予定だったんですが、\nご挨拶が遅れまして……765プロです。", "zh": "抱歉，本来打算之后再来拜访的，可是问候晚了……我是765制作人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1017_013hib", "source_sha256": "4c01949508f4100d049310970f6d1da535cfff556f1927457cf8c451600079b1", "ja": "自分、我那覇響だぞっ！　どんな仕事でも、\nカンペキにこなしてみせるから、期待しててね！", "zh": "我就是我那霸响哦！不管是什么工作，我都会完美完成给你看，所以尽管期待吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1018_023aka", "source_sha256": "b1ab941ce0677a326818d4139aea13b423a2cc68bbde4375e0daee1b305b18b1", "ja": "765プロのマスコット、野々原茜ちゃんでーす！\n社長ちゃんも、愛しちゃっていいゾ？　ニャハッ☆", "zh": "765PRO的吉祥物，野野原小茜来啦～！\n社长也可以尽情爱我哦？喵哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1019_shachochan", "source_sha256": "5eee1a983f45cbfb8119ba2cef033ca72bffdb72e7041d3c6e2f4963fc7aaf33", "ja": "おおっ、ふたりともええな～♪　キャラ濃くて！\nあ、早速打ち合わせしたいんやけど……時間ある？", "zh": "哦哦，你们俩都很不错嘛～♪　个性十足！\n啊，我想马上和你们商量一下……有时间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1020_013hib", "source_sha256": "a95d663d5af018bcacf04948b7a2de8d4e860879b9dd7b574472362bef3fbe08", "ja": "あ、ええと……{$P$}、いい？\nレッスンまで少し時間あるよね。", "zh": "啊，这个……{$P$}，可以吗？\n离上课还有点时间吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1021_p", "source_sha256": "a425557e6a2972f7a0648a456b39eecf591cdb08d112faa3c8a916af6fbe82e9", "ja": "ああ、いいよ。俺はちょっと外すけど、\n時間になったら迎えに来るから……それじゃ！", "zh": "嗯，好啊。我先出去一下，时间到了会来接你的……那就先这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1023_shachochan", "source_sha256": "42b28b0cf71d97ef1bad90ff94bcfa5e15f9a5974d2fe7746d084513745eaf6b", "ja": "じゃーんっ！　ここがうちらのブース！\nぎゃんかわやろ～♪", "zh": "锵——！这里就是我们的摊位！\n超级可爱吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1024_013hib", "source_sha256": "9b7279c9ba0babc678f75f5851e596a8fc80eb2b52ffea2f1ca3bb92af75e88b", "ja": "わぁ、すっごくオシャレな雰囲気だぞ！\nお弁当屋さんって言うより、カフェって感じだね。", "zh": "哇，好时髦的氛围啊！\n与其说是便当店，感觉更像是咖啡馆呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1025_023aka", "source_sha256": "75eb40aa0a16d5bd0bcc5f0b554b9d4ed741492fb3ad91d0da7c6b5adc41e1fa", "ja": "ふむふむ……「今、密かに広がる、お弁当ブームの\n火付け役！　新進気鋭のフードコーディネーター」……", "zh": "嗯嗯……“如今正在悄然兴起的便当热潮的引领者！新锐美食策划师”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1026_023aka", "source_sha256": "605633cf00144250816a0c9ad7fc418b85725d965a7f9947d21b7c9d8da6bf54", "ja": "社長ちゃん、メチャクチャ有名人じゃん！\nSNSとかでも、かなり話題になってるし……。", "zh": "社长姐姐，你可是超级大名人啊！\n在社交媒体上也引发了好多话题……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1027_shachochan", "source_sha256": "8fc6cb5886765db152a2ceaff8894a11b0b1f0424baae2153f99b05dae86dd88", "ja": "あはは、大げさすぎやん！　昔から料理だけは\n好きだったから、なんとか楽しくやれてるだけよ。", "zh": "啊哈哈，也太夸张了吧！我只是从以前开始就喜欢做菜，所以才能想办法开心地做下去而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1028_013hib", "source_sha256": "9fdf47be03c9488c8ce854a9d1a89f2e92732acaf93d4f0b749ba1de361db4f2", "ja": "自分が楽しむのっていうのは、大事だよね！\nそういうのって、お客さんに伝わるもんだから。", "zh": "享受自己做这件事，很重要对吧！因为这种心情，客人也能感受到的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1029_shachochan", "source_sha256": "c452c09c05e0f37434b8d99c86f776beebc2846ad3ef6b1e04012bfa6d8c752b", "ja": "それな♪　お客さんがうちの\n弁当で笑顔になってくれたら、一番嬉しいわ。", "zh": "就是嘛♪要是客人能因为我们家的便当露出笑容，那就最开心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1030_023aka", "source_sha256": "ec16f51d6bdfadf048ef9766a4f36893816d70b3b71e23a134a1dac026d986aa", "ja": "わかる、わかるよ！　アイドルも同じだもんね。\nお客さんの笑顔が、なによりのご褒美だから。", "zh": "我懂，我懂！偶像也是一样嘛。客人的笑容，就是最好的奖励。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1031_shachochan", "source_sha256": "66928f63948ccd754f42c9648aea4258fdc002f9ae71709548071c0d3a7b14f0", "ja": "せやせや♪　ぶっちゃけうちは好きにやってるだけで、\n経営とかはわからんよ。全部兄ちゃん任せや。", "zh": "对对♪ 说白了，我也就是想怎么做就怎么做，经营什么的完全不懂。全都交给哥哥了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1032_013hib", "source_sha256": "251f05d8fff05d7aed3414999355372859bd9ffaa6485f51531d0d46c15a03f0", "ja": "へえ！　社長ちゃんにも、にーにーがいるの？\n自分も故郷に、にーにーがいるんだよね。", "zh": "诶！社长也有哥哥吗？\n我在故乡也有个哥哥呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1033_shachochan", "source_sha256": "04fab9ef26abeaf49f778babf411c583f924c99d534c72c711a92aba2e470bcf", "ja": "そうなんや？　っていうか響ちゃん、\n「にーにー」って呼び方、メッチャかわいいな♪", "zh": "是这样啊？话说回来，响，你称呼对方为“哥哥”的方式，真的超可爱♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1034_013hib", "source_sha256": "adb1d9c7b8e8d158c36e6aeae514cbb2c4060bbff1517ebdb16cac84b2e135e6", "ja": "えっ……そ、そう？　なんかそう言われると、\n急に恥ずかしくなってきたぞ、うぅ……。", "zh": "诶……是、是吗？你这么一说，我突然觉得好害羞啊，呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1035_013hib", "source_sha256": "3ea09ddea7555c99360cc5ee22be76106e4242c78035bd5ee39e08e680c3c2aa", "ja": "あ、それで……！　故郷で思い出したけど、自分、\n沖縄料理なら教えられるぞ！　お弁当勝負でどうかな？", "zh": "啊，对了……！说到故乡，我想起来了。我可以教你做冲绳料理哦！来比一场便当，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1036_shachochan", "source_sha256": "de09d9ffbe672435dce62ad68a09df6f11867d0aab5a1079374040f388e3f663", "ja": "マ！？　お弁当に沖縄料理……\nうん、それメッチャいいかも！　教えて教えて！", "zh": "真的假的！？　便当里放冲绳料理……\n嗯，这个说不定超棒！快告诉我快告诉我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1037_023aka", "source_sha256": "c2b4bf869d6c5bb8d94f484559c4a270941a8cc6abd3ef33acc21fe2929032df", "ja": "ん～、そういうことなら……。\n茜ちゃんは、経営面のサポートに回ろうかな！", "zh": "嗯～，既然这样……至于小茜，要不要转去负责经营方面的支援呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1038_023aka", "source_sha256": "3efd1013fe84d95022ada7141b8ab61356e8f128d6e71b5bbca36f3678fde4d0", "ja": "今こそ、グッズ販売で得たノウハウを活かす時！\nドーンと任せてくれていいヨ！", "zh": "现在正是发挥周边商品销售经验的时候！\n尽管交给茜酱吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1039_shachochan", "source_sha256": "58d123768321c7847546ae1af3fa73beee800ef672f7644d565c1f5b10542fb6", "ja": "え、茜ちゃん、アイドルしながら商売もやってるん！？\nやば……メッチャ頼もしい～！", "zh": "咦，小茜，你一边当偶像还一边做生意吗！？\n好厉害……太可靠了吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1040_023aka", "source_sha256": "eb4e826443d1549b6aa340a86b6ea0bb11a77dce358196c0b0ed260f7ca0e99a", "ja": "ニャハハ☆　茜ちゃんとひびきん、そして社長ちゃん\n……これ、無敵のチームできちゃったんじゃない！？", "zh": "喵哈哈☆　小茜、响响，还有社长\n……这不是已经组成无敌的队伍了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_04_1041_013hib", "source_sha256": "cb2a0e73660dee73886caec7a771d1270048fee62b6aa07ececfe3258833e05e", "ja": "うんうん、負ける気がしないぞ！\n自分達、全力で勝ちを取りにいっちゃおー！", "zh": "嗯嗯，感觉根本不会输！\n咱们要全力以赴，把胜利拿下来——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
